    "q-168150": {
      "dom_id": "step-q168150",
      "name": "Question 9",
      "problem": "Given a rectangular solid, find the differential $\\text{d}V$ for the volume $V$ of the rectangular solid if the lengths of the sides are $a=6,$ $b=3,$ and $c=8.$",
      "worked_solution": "The volume of the rectangular solid is $V=abc.$ Let's find the differential:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}V(a,b,c) & =(\\frac{∂V}{∂a})\\,\\text{d}a+(\\frac{∂V}{∂b})\\,\\text{d}b+(\\frac{∂V}{∂c})\\,\\text{d}c \\\\  & =bc\\,\\text{d}a+ac\\,\\text{d}b+ab\\,\\text{d}c\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $a=6,$ $b=3,$ and $c=8,$ the differential is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}V(6,3,8) & =3\\cdot 8\\,\\text{d}a+6\\cdot 8\\,\\text{d}b+6\\cdot 3\\,\\text{d}c \\\\  & =24\\,\\text{d}a+48\\,\\text{d}b+18\\,\\text{d}c.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-168150-a",
